# Supabase CLOUD backend (hosted at supabase.com - NO Docker required)
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create a project at https://database.new  (free tier is enough)
#   2. Dashboard -> Project Settings -> "Data API" (or API):
#        Project URL        -> NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
#        Anon / Publishable key -> NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   3. Copy this file to .env.cloud and paste those two values.
#   4. Apply the schema: Dashboard -> SQL Editor -> paste
#      supabase/migrations/20261027000001_init.sql -> Run.
#   5. npm run env:cloud  &&  restart the dev server.
#
# `.env.cloud` is gitignored - NEVER commit real credentials.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key
